<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">掠过波光粼粼的水面</text><text for="L2">忘我地迎风飞翔</text><text for="L3">振起双翼</text><text for="L4">向那座城市飞去吧</text><text for="L5">越过大海</text><text for="L6">我啊 是一只小小的燕子</text><text for="L7">在终于抵达的城市里听见</text><text for="L8">人们欢欣的声音</text><text for="L9">伙伴哀伤的声音</text><text for="L10">每个人都有各不相同的生活模样</text><text for="L11">明明只是想守护这一切 却在不知不觉间</text><text for="L12">为何还是伤害了彼此</text><text for="L13">明明都在同一片天空之下</text><text for="L14">我们与这世间缤纷各异的生命</text><text for="L15">在这里共同生活着</text><text for="L16">人与草木 花朵与飞鸟</text><text for="L17">都在彼此依偎</text><text for="L18">我们所求各不相同</text><text for="L19">心中描绘的未来也各有不同</text><text for="L20">但若能牵起彼此的手</text><text for="L21">一定会有相视而笑的那一天</text><text for="L22">现在的我 能做些什么呢</text><text for="L23">在有人获得富足的背后</text><text for="L24">却有伙伴被夺去了归处</text><text for="L25">其实他也只想和大家相依相伴</text><text for="L26">一起活下去而已</text><text for="L27">纵然被悲伤吞没</text><text for="L28">心也渐渐染上黑色</text><text for="L29">只要学会宽恕 学会接纳</text><text for="L30">我们便能彼此相连</text><text for="L31">此刻我们能做的事</text><text for="L32">即使只凭这些 无法改变一切</text><text for="L33">你看 也能为某个人的一天</text><text for="L34">添上一抹鲜亮的色彩</text><text for="L35">虽不是什么璀璨的宝石</text><text for="L36">也并非闪亮的金箔</text><text for="L37">若整个世界都能像这样</text><text for="L38">盈满点滴小小的爱</text><text for="L39">你看 一定会有什么改变</text><text for="L40">总有一天 就在这同一片天空下</text><text for="L41">这就是小小的我 大大的梦想</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:37.429"><div begin="3.935" end="22.207" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="3.935" end="8.324" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.935" end="4.784">煌</span><span begin="4.784" end="5.252">く</span><span begin="5.368" end="6.218">水面</span><span begin="6.218" end="7.082">の上</span><span begin="7.082" end="8.324">を</span></p><p begin="8.521" end="12.701" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.521" end="9.737">夢中で</span><span begin="9.932" end="10.364">風</span><span begin="10.364" end="11.063">切り</span><span begin="11.063" end="11.663">翔</span><span begin="11.663" end="12.701">る</span></p><p begin="13.042" end="16.839" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.042" end="14.418">翼を</span><span begin="14.778" end="16.229">はためかせ</span><span begin="16.229" end="16.839">て</span></p><p begin="16.981" end="19.948" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.981" end="17.605">あの</span><span begin="17.605" end="18.487">街へ</span><span begin="18.487" end="19.948">行こう</span></p><p begin="19.953" end="22.207" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.953" end="20.734">海を</span><span begin="20.734" end="22.207">越えて</span></p></div><div begin="22.257" end="40.486" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="22.257" end="26.047" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.257" end="23.046">僕は</span><span begin="23.046" end="23.358">そう</span><span begin="23.630" end="24.748">小さな</span><span begin="24.748" end="25.348">ツバ</span><span begin="25.348" end="26.047">メ</span></p><p begin="26.781" end="30.844" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.781" end="27.632">辿り</span><span begin="27.632" end="28.448">着いた</span><span begin="28.448" end="29.931">街で触れ</span><span begin="29.931" end="30.844">た</span></p><p begin="31.393" end="35.148" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.393" end="32.169">楽し</span><span begin="32.169" end="32.836">そう</span><span begin="33.070" end="34.174">な人の</span><span begin="34.174" end="35.148">声</span></p><p begin="35.309" end="40.486" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.309" end="36.813">悲しみに</span><span begin="36.813" end="38.013">暮れる</span><span begin="38.213" end="39.480">仲間の</span><span begin="39.480" end="40.486">声</span></p></div><div begin="40.490" end="57.698" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="40.490" end="45.612" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.490" end="41.063">みんな</span><span begin="41.063" end="42.181">それぞれ</span><span begin="42.181" end="43.349">違う</span><span begin="43.349" end="44.479">暮らしの</span><span begin="44.479" end="45.612">形</span></p><p begin="45.882" end="50.352" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.882" end="47.066">守りた</span><span begin="47.066" end="47.914">くて</span><span begin="47.914" end="49.946">気付かないうち</span><span begin="49.946" end="50.352">に</span></p><p begin="50.512" end="54.685" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.512" end="51.061">傷</span><span begin="51.061" end="52.077">付け合っ</span><span begin="52.077" end="53.941">てしまうのは</span><span begin="53.941" end="54.685">なぜ</span></p><p begin="54.755" end="57.698" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.755" end="55.633">同じ</span><span begin="55.633" end="56.499">空の</span><span begin="56.499" end="57.698">下で</span></p></div><div begin="58.798" end="1:40.089" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="58.798" end="1:03.583" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.798" end="59.643">僕ら</span><span begin="59.643" end="1:00.227">は</span><span begin="1:00.227" end="1:01.910">色とりどり</span><span begin="1:01.910" end="1:02.487">の</span><span begin="1:02.487" end="1:03.583">命と</span></p><p begin="1:03.593" end="1:07.822" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.593" end="1:04.257">この</span><span begin="1:04.257" end="1:05.441">場所で</span><span begin="1:05.641" end="1:06.524">共に</span><span begin="1:06.524" end="1:07.822">生きている</span></p><p begin="1:07.832" end="1:13.344" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.832" end="1:09.354">それぞれ</span><span begin="1:09.354" end="1:10.221">人も</span><span begin="1:10.221" end="1:11.704">草木も</span><span begin="1:11.704" end="1:12.485">花も</span><span begin="1:12.485" end="1:13.344">鳥も</span></p><p begin="1:13.354" end="1:16.917" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.354" end="1:13.908">肩</span><span begin="1:13.908" end="1:15.698">寄せ合いなが</span><span begin="1:15.698" end="1:16.917">ら</span></p><p begin="1:17.027" end="1:20.761" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.027" end="1:18.520">僕らは</span><span begin="1:18.520" end="1:20.221">求めるもの</span><span begin="1:20.221" end="1:20.761">も</span></p><p begin="1:20.771" end="1:26.146" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.771" end="1:22.214">描いてる</span><span begin="1:22.214" end="1:23.947">未来も</span><span begin="1:23.947" end="1:24.814">違う</span><span begin="1:24.814" end="1:26.146">けれど</span></p><p begin="1:26.246" end="1:29.951" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.246" end="1:27.115">手と手</span><span begin="1:27.115" end="1:27.660">を</span><span begin="1:27.660" end="1:29.409">取り合えたな</span><span begin="1:29.409" end="1:29.951">ら</span></p><p begin="1:29.951" end="1:34.722" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.951" end="1:30.764">きっと</span><span begin="1:30.764" end="1:31.647">笑い</span><span begin="1:31.647" end="1:33.066">合える日が</span><span begin="1:33.066" end="1:33.930">来るか</span><span begin="1:33.930" end="1:34.722">ら</span></p><p begin="1:34.792" end="1:40.089" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.792" end="1:35.901">僕には</span><span begin="1:35.901" end="1:36.501">いま</span><span begin="1:36.501" end="1:38.517">何ができるか</span><span begin="1:38.517" end="1:40.089">な</span></p></div><div begin="1:55.944" end="2:14.145" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:55.944" end="2:01.258" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.944" end="1:57.061">誰かが</span><span begin="1:57.061" end="1:57.925">手に入</span><span begin="1:57.925" end="1:58.792">れた</span><span begin="1:58.792" end="2:00.224">豊かさの</span><span begin="2:00.224" end="2:01.258">裏で</span></p><p begin="2:01.335" end="2:05.769" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.335" end="2:02.212">帰る</span><span begin="2:02.212" end="2:03.231">場所を</span><span begin="2:03.375" end="2:04.775">奪われた</span><span begin="2:04.775" end="2:05.769">仲間</span></p><p begin="2:05.889" end="2:10.159" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.889" end="2:07.084">本当は</span><span begin="2:07.084" end="2:07.745">彼</span><span begin="2:07.950" end="2:09.366">も寄り添い</span><span begin="2:09.366" end="2:09.764">合っ</span><span begin="2:09.764" end="2:10.159">て</span></p><p begin="2:10.189" end="2:14.145" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.189" end="2:11.093">生きてい</span><span begin="2:11.093" end="2:12.813">たいだけなの</span><span begin="2:12.813" end="2:14.145">に</span></p></div><div begin="2:14.495" end="2:32.440" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:14.495" end="2:18.981" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.495" end="2:15.634">悲しい</span><span begin="2:15.634" end="2:16.751">気持ち</span><span begin="2:16.751" end="2:18.516">に飲み込まれ</span><span begin="2:18.516" end="2:18.981">て</span></p><p begin="2:19.061" end="2:23.536" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.061" end="2:20.221">心が</span><span begin="2:20.221" end="2:21.368">黒く</span><span begin="2:21.368" end="2:22.219">染まり</span><span begin="2:22.219" end="2:23.536">かけても</span></p><p begin="2:23.626" end="2:28.134" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.626" end="2:24.775">許す</span><span begin="2:24.775" end="2:25.924">ことで</span><span begin="2:25.924" end="2:27.642">認めること</span><span begin="2:27.642" end="2:28.134">で</span></p><p begin="2:28.224" end="2:32.440" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.224" end="2:29.331">僕らは</span><span begin="2:29.331" end="2:31.080">繋がり合え</span><span begin="2:31.080" end="2:32.440">る</span></p></div><div begin="2:32.450" end="3:26.180" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:32.450" end="2:36.160" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.450" end="2:33.373">僕ら</span><span begin="2:33.373" end="2:33.957">に</span><span begin="2:33.957" end="2:35.621">いまできるこ</span><span begin="2:35.621" end="2:36.160">と</span></p><p begin="2:36.170" end="2:41.652" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.170" end="2:37.626">それだけで</span><span begin="2:37.626" end="2:39.340">全てが</span><span begin="2:39.340" end="2:41.359">変わらなくたっ</span><span begin="2:41.359" end="2:41.652">て</span></p><p begin="2:41.662" end="2:45.281" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.662" end="2:43.065">誰かの</span><span begin="2:43.065" end="2:44.481">一日に</span><span begin="2:44.481" end="2:45.281">ほら</span></p><p begin="2:45.281" end="2:50.536" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.281" end="2:46.198">少し</span><span begin="2:46.198" end="2:46.782">だけ</span><span begin="2:46.782" end="2:48.230">鮮やかな</span><span begin="2:48.230" end="2:49.081">彩</span><span begin="2:49.081" end="2:49.364">り</span><span begin="2:49.364" end="2:50.536">を</span></p><p begin="2:50.766" end="2:55.045" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.766" end="2:52.214">輝く</span><span begin="2:52.214" end="2:53.382">宝石</span><span begin="2:53.382" end="2:53.931">だと</span><span begin="2:53.931" end="2:55.045">か</span></p><p begin="2:55.365" end="2:59.262" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.365" end="2:56.760">金箔</span><span begin="2:56.760" end="2:58.525">ではないけれ</span><span begin="2:58.525" end="2:59.262">ど</span></p><p begin="2:59.352" end="3:03.723" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.352" end="3:00.240">こんな</span><span begin="3:00.240" end="3:01.341">風に</span><span begin="3:01.619" end="3:03.723">世界中が</span></p><p begin="3:03.793" end="3:08.371" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.793" end="3:05.374">ささやかな</span><span begin="3:05.374" end="3:06.225">愛で</span><span begin="3:06.225" end="3:07.654">溢れたな</span><span begin="3:07.654" end="3:08.371">ら</span></p><p begin="3:08.461" end="3:12.931" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.461" end="3:09.664">何かが</span><span begin="3:09.664" end="3:10.496">ほら</span><span begin="3:10.813" end="3:12.237">変わるはず</span><span begin="3:12.237" end="3:12.931">さ</span></p><p begin="3:13.041" end="3:17.560" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.041" end="3:13.916">同じ</span><span begin="3:13.916" end="3:14.745">空の</span><span begin="3:14.745" end="3:15.313">下</span><span begin="3:15.313" end="3:16.780">いつかきっ</span><span begin="3:16.780" end="3:17.560">と</span></p><p begin="3:17.570" end="3:26.180" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.570" end="3:18.501">それが</span><span begin="3:18.501" end="3:19.650">小さな</span><span begin="3:19.650" end="3:20.269">僕</span><span begin="3:20.269" end="3:21.522">の</span><span begin="3:22.202" end="3:23.351">大きな</span><span begin="3:23.351" end="3:26.180">夢</span></p></div></body></tt>